        "description": "Episodes of recurrent corneal inflammation and pain",
        "category": "minor",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of bilateral corneal stromal opacities and a positive family history consistent with autosomal dominant inheritance; genetic confirmation supportive but not mandatory",
    "notes": "Genetic testing can confirm diagnosis but clinical features and family history are critical."
